        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "快來看看！絕對不會讓你失望。體驗經典的港式霓虹燈氛圍，品嚐城裡性價比最高的港式燒臘之一。氣氛、地理位置、簡單明了（對外國人也很友善​​）的菜單，以及營業至凌晨3點的營業時間，都讓這家店獨具特色，值得一試。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Check this out! You won’t be disappointed. Experience a classic Hong Kong-style neon ambience with one of the best value HK-style BBQs in town. The vibe, location, straightforward (gweilo friendly) menu, and opening hours until 3 AM make this place unique and worth trying.",
